---
description: Shared repository and task coordination rules for Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository-wide instructions in `AGENTS.md` and the task assignment in `docs/agent-workplan.md`. Work only in the worktree and branch assigned to this Cursor session. Do not modify another agent's worktree or work directly on `main`. Confirm ownership, scope, interfaces, and acceptance criteria before implementation. Report completed changes and checks to the coordinator.
